msgid "SORT_INSTRUCTIONS"
msgstr "Select a Flipnote with the arrow keys, and drag and drop with the space bar. Leaving this folder without hitting \"Confirm\" will discard your changes."

msgid "SORT_INSTRUCTIONS_CONTROLLER"
msgstr "Select a Flipnote with the D-PAD, and drag and drop with the A or X (Playstation) button. Leaving this folder without hitting \"Confirm\" will discard your changes."

msgid "SORT_INSTRUCTIONS_WIIMOTE"
msgstr "Select a Flipnote by hovering your pointer over it, and drag by holding A + B. Leaving this folder without hitting \"Confirm\" will discard your changes."

